WEBVTT

00:00:12.922 --> 00:00:14.924
[ Panting ]

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.407
♪♪ [ Humming ] [ Line Ringing ]

00:00:20.451 --> 00:00:21.974
[ Grunts ]

00:00:24.455 --> 00:00:26.326
[ Minionese ]

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:28.198
[ Phone Ringing ][ Growls ]

00:00:28.241 --> 00:00:31.984
[ Minionese ]

00:00:32.028 --> 00:00:34.987
♪♪ [ "Make 'Em Laugh"
In Minionese ]

00:00:39.818 --> 00:00:41.080
[ Honking ]

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:43.604
[ Growling ]

00:00:43.648 --> 00:00:46.694
♪♪ [ Singing Continues ]

00:00:50.568 --> 00:00:52.526
[ Ringing ][ Laughing Rhythmically ]

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:53.832
Bello?

00:00:53.876 --> 00:00:55.442
Hey, Kevin!

00:00:55.486 --> 00:00:56.617
Eh?

00:00:56.661 --> 00:00:58.271
[ Minionese ]
In England?

00:00:58.315 --> 00:01:00.708
Nah--
[ Minionese ]

00:01:00.752 --> 00:01:05.104
♪♪ [ Singing Continues ]

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:07.019
[ Blows Tuba ]

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:09.369
[ Laughing ]

00:01:09.413 --> 00:01:10.849
[ Groans ]

00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:14.853
Ah. Uh, bello, Kevin?

00:01:14.897 --> 00:01:17.116
[ Minionese ]
England? [ Kevin, Indistinct ]

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:20.163
[ Minionese ]
Scarlet Popapil. Ah.[ Yetis Growling ]

00:01:20.206 --> 00:01:22.643
[ Minion Shouting ]

00:01:22.687 --> 00:01:24.907
[ Screaming ]

00:01:26.691 --> 00:01:28.562
[ Roars ]

00:01:28.606 --> 00:01:30.390
[ Busy Line ]Bello?

00:01:30.434 --> 00:01:31.696
Bello!

00:01:31.739 --> 00:01:33.916
¿Qué pasó?
Bello?

00:01:41.749 --> 00:01:44.274
[ Gasping ]Wow!

00:01:49.192 --> 00:01:51.498
Ahh!
[ Grunting ]

00:01:51.542 --> 00:01:53.587
[ Whimpers ]

00:01:53.631 --> 00:01:56.503
Here we go.
There.
好了

00:01:56.547 --> 00:01:59.506
By the way,
I really like your bear.
我很喜欢你的小熊

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:03.467
Herb! My baby.You know I am.
合毕！我的宝贝！

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:06.470
How'd it go?
Were you evil?[ Giggles ]
怎么样？你表现的够邪恶吗？

00:02:06.513 --> 00:02:08.689
So evil!Oh!
邪恶极了！

00:02:08.733 --> 00:02:10.953
A little bird
dropped this off today.
有只小鸟带来了这个

00:02:12.215 --> 00:02:14.521
[ Herb Whispering ]
"I missed you. H."
想念你！合

00:02:14.565 --> 00:02:17.307
It's me.
I'm the "H."
是我，“合”就是我

00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:20.223
Also, there was no bird.
Also me.
还有，根本没什么鸟，全都是我

00:02:20.266 --> 00:02:22.225
Herb, seriously,
合比，我真想
把莎士比亚从坟墓挖起…

00:02:22.268 --> 00:02:26.490
I wanna dig up
that William Shakespeare so he
can see what true writing is.
好让他见识真正的诗词

00:02:26.533 --> 00:02:28.231
I love it.
我爱极了！

00:02:28.274 --> 00:02:30.798
Ah, that works out
because I love--
[ Chuckles ]
那当然，因为我爱…

00:02:30.842 --> 00:02:33.714
Well, I love--
[ Chuckles ]
too.
我也爱…

00:02:33.758 --> 00:02:35.847
Ah, the love, ah!
我也爱…

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:37.849
[ Imitates Kissing ][ Laughing ]

00:02:37.892 --> 00:02:39.372
[ Scarlet ]
Oh, boys--Huh?
男孩们，请过来

00:02:39.416 --> 00:02:41.461
Could you come here,
please?
男孩们，请过来

00:02:41.505 --> 00:02:44.116
Meet my husband, Herb.
这是我丈夫，合比

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:48.642
Inventor,
super genius, fox.
[ Sighs ]
发明家，超级天才，英俊潇洒

00:02:48.686 --> 00:02:50.993
Herb, these are
the new recruits--
合比，这些是我新聘请的…

00:02:51.036 --> 00:02:54.039
Kevin, Stuart, and that
cute little one is Bob.
凯文，史都华，和可爱的小鲍比

00:02:54.083 --> 00:02:55.736
Hey, Bello.
[ Minionese ]
凯文，史都华，和可爱的小鲍比

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:59.392
Right on!
You guys are crazy, little
and way yellow,
好极了！你们好小好黄…

00:02:59.436 --> 00:03:01.960
and I dig that!
我喜欢！

00:03:02.004 --> 00:03:03.744
Huh?
[ Stammering ]

00:03:05.442 --> 00:03:07.748
- Sweet, man!
- [ Yelps ]
好耶！

00:03:07.792 --> 00:03:09.011
Ahh, ahh.

00:03:12.579 --> 00:03:15.582
[ Minionese ]I know, right?
是啊

00:03:15.626 --> 00:03:19.108
Just a few things I stole
to help fill the void.
只是些为了填补空洞偷来的东西

00:03:19.151 --> 00:03:21.501
Whoa!
[ Minionese ]

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:26.593
Checkin' out my can?
在欣赏我的战利品？

00:03:26.637 --> 00:03:30.293
We stole that because finally
someone expressed my love
of soup in painting form.
那画家把我对浓汤的爱画的丝丝入扣

00:03:30.336 --> 00:03:32.121
Wow!Ooh!
那画家把我对浓汤的爱画的丝丝入扣

00:03:32.164 --> 00:03:36.299
Okay, listen up!
It is time to get down
to business.
听好！是时候做正经事了

00:03:36.342 --> 00:03:38.301
Do you know
who this is?
你们知道这是谁吗？

00:03:38.344 --> 00:03:40.694
Uh, la cucaracha?

00:03:40.738 --> 00:03:44.872
This is Queen Elizabeth,
ruler of England.
伊丽莎白女皇，英国的统治者

00:03:44.916 --> 00:03:47.571
Oh, I loveEngland.
我热爱英国和她们的音乐，时尚

00:03:47.614 --> 00:03:49.703
The music,
the fashion.
我热爱英国和她们的音乐，时尚

00:03:49.747 --> 00:03:52.054
I'm seriously thinking about
overthrowing it someday.
我认真的想推翻那王国

00:03:52.097 --> 00:03:54.404
[ Gasps ]
Ooh!
[ Minionese ]

00:03:54.447 --> 00:03:58.016
Anyway,
this pale drink of water
oversees it all.
那里不该让这乏味的女人作主

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:00.975
I'm her biggest fan,
love her work.
虽然我很欣赏她的作品！

00:04:01.019 --> 00:04:04.066
And I really, really,
really want her crown.
也非常想得到她的皇冠

00:04:04.109 --> 00:04:06.416
[ Minionese ][ Giggling ]

00:04:08.026 --> 00:04:11.116
Steal me the crown,
and all your dreams
come true.
把皇冠偷来，我会让你们美梦成真

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:13.597
Respect!
Power!
你们会得到所有人的爱戴！权利！

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:14.772
Banana!
你们会得到所有人的爱戴！权利！

00:04:15.512 --> 00:04:17.166
Banana!
香蕉！

00:04:17.209 --> 00:04:19.081
Whoo-hoo![ Minionese ]

00:04:20.734 --> 00:04:22.214
[ Kevin Chuckling ]

00:04:25.696 --> 00:04:27.567
[ Groaning ]

00:04:27.611 --> 00:04:29.003
[ Gasps ]
Henry!

00:04:30.309 --> 00:04:31.919
[ Shuddering ]

00:04:32.964 --> 00:04:35.140
[ Minionese ]

00:04:35.184 --> 00:04:36.533
[ Groans, Minionese ]

00:04:39.362 --> 00:04:41.190
[ Gasps ]

00:04:41.233 --> 00:04:43.192
[ Growls ]

00:04:43.235 --> 00:04:45.107
[ Screaming ][ Roaring ]

00:04:51.939 --> 00:04:53.027
[ Roars ]

00:04:54.246 --> 00:04:56.335
[ Chuckles ][ Screams ]

00:04:57.815 --> 00:05:00.339
[ Roars ][ Shouting In Minionese ]

00:05:02.646 --> 00:05:04.213
Oh! Ahh!

00:05:04.256 --> 00:05:05.910
Hmm?
[ Minionese ]

00:05:05.953 --> 00:05:07.346
[ Minionese ]

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:09.174
Wow![ Chuckling ]
Wow.

00:05:09.218 --> 00:05:11.307
[ Laughing ]
Ooh-la-la.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:13.396
[ Herb ]
No! Oh, no.
不！糟了

00:05:13.439 --> 00:05:16.877
Don't get too close, boys.
When it's completed,
it'll be my ultimate weapon.
一旦完成，这将会是我的终极武器

00:05:16.921 --> 00:05:20.881
But right now,
it's leaking radiation
like you would not believe.
半成品却频频漏出辐射！

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:25.930
- [ Clatters ]
- So, you're here for gear.
你们需要佩带武器

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:29.499
Whoa!

00:05:29.542 --> 00:05:33.242
- Bob. Robert.
Bobby, my boy--
- ¿Sí?
鲍比，罗伯特，我的宝贝…

00:05:33.285 --> 00:05:36.375
You get my far-out
stretch suit.
你得到我的完美弹力衣

00:05:37.985 --> 00:05:39.726
Wow!
[ Chuckles ]

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:42.599
Kevin. Kev-bo.
Seventh Kevin--
凯文，凯宝贝…

00:05:42.642 --> 00:05:45.689
You are the proud owner
of my lava lamp gun.
你是这熔岩灯枪的新主人

00:05:45.732 --> 00:05:49.649
- Ah?
- This baby shoots actual lava!
这可是会发射真的熔岩！

00:05:49.693 --> 00:05:52.609
Ooh!
[ Minionese ]Pretty cool, right?
很酷，对吧？

00:05:52.652 --> 00:05:57.570
And finally, Stu.
Stu-art. Stu-perman. Beef Stu--
最后，史都华，史都比…

00:05:57.614 --> 00:06:00.312
I got you the coolest invention,
probably ever.
我挑了件最眩目的发明

00:06:00.356 --> 00:06:03.924
[ Chuckling, Minionese ]Hypno-hat!
催眠帽！

00:06:03.968 --> 00:06:05.926
[ Stammering ]

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:10.322
[ Stammers ][ Clucking ]

00:06:10.366 --> 00:06:12.803
You can use it
to hypnotize anyone.
你可以用来催眠任何人！

00:06:12.846 --> 00:06:14.065
Anyone!
你可以用来催眠任何人！

00:06:14.108 --> 00:06:16.937
Oh, you look so great.
好看极了！

00:06:16.981 --> 00:06:20.854
I feel like a proud mama
with three dashing evil sons.
我就像是拥有三个帅儿子的母亲

00:06:20.898 --> 00:06:24.423
Uh, Scarlet--
Scarlet--
[ Minionese ]
我就像是拥有三个帅儿子的母亲

00:06:24.467 --> 00:06:26.643
No, no.
Don't say anything.
I won't understand.
不，别说，反正我也听不懂

00:06:26.686 --> 00:06:28.384
[ Bob Whimpering ]It's getting late.
很晚了，你们忙了一天应该累了

00:06:28.427 --> 00:06:31.952
You've had a big day.
You must be exhausted.
很晚了，你们忙了一天应该累了

00:06:31.996 --> 00:06:36.087
Boing, boing, boing, boing,
boing, boing--[ Herb ] Wow!
哇，这组合真令人兴奋！

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:38.263
These cats are pumped!Boing, boing, boing--
哇，这组合真令人兴奋！

00:06:38.307 --> 00:06:41.701
Well, maybe I'll settle them
down with a bedtime story?
我应该给它们讲个睡前故事

00:06:41.745 --> 00:06:44.138
[ Laughing, Gasping ]
我应该给它们讲个睡前故事

00:06:44.182 --> 00:06:46.924
[ Screams ][ Bob ]
Boing, boing--

00:06:46.967 --> 00:06:48.404
How does that sound, Bob?Boing, boing--
你说好吗，鲍比？鲍比！

00:06:48.447 --> 00:06:50.449
Bob. Bob. Bob!Boing, boing--
你说好吗，鲍比？鲍比！

00:06:50.493 --> 00:06:52.277
Oh!
Bedtime "porry"?
你说好吗，鲍比？鲍比！

00:06:52.321 --> 00:06:53.974
That is a groovy idea!
这主意不错！

00:06:54.018 --> 00:06:55.541
I'll go get some cookies
and warm milk.
我这就去拿饼干和温牛奶

00:06:55.585 --> 00:06:59.110
This is gonna be sofun!
这会很有趣！

00:06:59.153 --> 00:07:01.199
[ Minionese ]

00:07:01.243 --> 00:07:05.595
Oh, yes, I've got a really,
really good bedtime "porry."
我有一个很好的睡前故事

00:07:05.638 --> 00:07:10.034
Once upon a time,
there were three little pigs.
很久以前，有三只小猪

